# Query cache docs

When you change `src/query/cachePolicy.ts`, a query key, a route loader prefetch, persist rules, or `invalidateQueries`, update [`docs/caching.md`](docs/caching.md) in the same change.

That page is the human map of what we fetch, how long we keep it, and what mutations refresh.
